        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Under air, H2L1 (48.2 mg, 0.2 mmol) in EtOH (20 mL) was treated with Zn(ClO4)2·6H2O (74 mg, 0.2 mmol) and Dy(OTf)3 (61 mg, 0.1 mmol), stirred 5 min, then Et3N (62 μL, 0.45 mmol) was added and stirring continued for 1 h. The cloudy yellow solution was filtered and left at room temperature; small yellow crystals formed after 4 days. The shared procedure covers the Dy/Tb/Eu series 1–3; CHN for 1 matches six coordinated EtOH molecules.",
